sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant API as Friday API
  participant S as MCP server
  participant M as AI model

  U->>API: Settings: add name + https URL + auth
  API->>S: initialize → Mcp-Session-Id
  API->>S: tools/list
  S-->>API: Tools + JSON schemas
  API->>API: Save (auth encrypted), sanitize schemas
  U->>API: Chat message
  API->>M: Tools incl. mcp_server_tool
  M-->>API: Call mcp_server_tool(args)
  API->>S: tools/call (SSRF guarded POST, JSON or SSE reply)
  S-->>API: content / isError
  API->>M: Result as untrusted data
  M-->>U: Answer
  API->>API: Audit log entry
